<title>UK: BNDES sets 150 million Swiss franc eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNDES sets 150 million Swiss franc eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BNDES</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    27.MAY.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.50    PAY DATE    27.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   21.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  BB1/BB-   DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
